# Storefronts and hosted forms (docs/public-host.md): every host but the
# app's goes to the public host. Preview addresses (<slug>.<preview
# domain>) and businesses' own domains each get a certificate the first
# time they are visited, once the public host's /tls/ask confirms it
# serves them; any other name is refused before a certificate is asked for.
# Copied into caddy.d/ by taskiem-vps setup when public pages are on.
https:// {
	tls {
		on_demand
	}
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy taskiem-public:8082
}
